<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper B · Listening review</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/b/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper B</p><h1>Paper B · Listening review</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper B</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><h2>15-minute listening track</h2><audio controls preload="metadata" src="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3"></audio><p>Use with questions 1–20. Each of four groups takes 3 minutes 45 seconds. Sources play twice; silence is intentional answer time.</p><a href="assets/audio/listening-full.mp3" download>Download full MP3</a></section><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h2>L1 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-1.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L2 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-2.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L3 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-3.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>L4 · 3:45</h2><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/listening-group-4.mp3"></audio><p>Five questions; each source twice, with answer time.</p></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Question-by-question listening review</h2><p>Short single-play clips below omit the long answer silence. Open a transcript only when reviewing.</p><div class="audio-list"><section class="box" id="C1B-M01"><h3>Question 1 · People at home</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m01.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我家有五个人：爷爷、爸爸、妈妈、姐姐和我。姐姐在大学读书，我在中学上学。我们都住在一起。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M02"><h3>Question 2 · Weekend family routines</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m02.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我妈妈是医生，星期六也要去医院。爸爸星期六不工作，在家做饭。我和哥哥下午一起回家吃饭。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M03"><h3>Question 3 · A family photograph</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m03.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我们拍全家照时，爷爷坐在中间。爸爸站在爷爷左边，妈妈在右边。姐姐和我站在后面。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M04"><h3>Question 4 · Introducing a family name</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m04.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">你们好，我姓马，叫马文。我的中文老师姓林。今天王老师带我来这个班，我很高兴认识大家。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M05"><h3>Question 5 · A school day</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m05.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我们上午在教室上课，中午去学校食堂吃饭。下午下课后，大家常常去操场运动。今天我也去。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M06"><h3>Question 6 · Putting bags away</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m06.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">同学们，请把书包放在椅子上，不要放在地上。桌子上只放书和本子。现在我们开始上课。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M07"><h3>Question 7 · A library rule</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m07.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">老师，我今天能借三本书吗？</p><p class="cn">每人一次只能借两本。你可以先选两本，明天还书以后再借。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M08"><h3>Question 8 · A lesson outside</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m08.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天体育课还在教室吗？</p><p class="cn">不，今天不下雨，我们去操场上课。</p><p class="cn">好的，我叫同学们一起去操场。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M09"><h3>Question 9 · Before opening the book</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m09.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">大家拿到纸了吗？请先在纸上写名字，再打开书。今天的练习很短，下课前我们一起看答案。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M10"><h3>Question 10 · Meeting before class</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m10.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">老师，下午两点上课，我想课前问一个问题。</p><p class="cn">可以，一点四十五来办公室吧。</p><p class="cn">好，我一点四十五到。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M11"><h3>Question 11 · Breakfast is changing</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m11.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我要两个面包和一杯牛奶。</p><p class="cn">面包卖完了，还有包子。</p><p class="cn">那我要两个包子吧，牛奶还是一杯。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M12"><h3>Question 12 · Drinks for the table</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m12.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我们这桌要三杯热茶、两杯冷水。热茶给爸爸妈妈和奶奶，冷水给我和弟弟。请不要拿错了。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M13"><h3>Question 13 · Choosing sweeter fruit</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m13.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天这些苹果怎么样？</p><p class="cn">有点儿酸，香蕉很甜。</p><p class="cn">我想买甜的。那我不要苹果了，买香蕉吧。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M14"><h3>Question 14 · Receiving change</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m14.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">这杯豆浆多少钱？</p><p class="cn">九块。</p><p class="cn">给你十块。</p><p class="cn">谢谢，找你一块。豆浆有点儿热，请小心。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M15"><h3>Question 15 · Whose scarf is it?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m15.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">门口有一件外套、一条围巾和一顶帽子。外套是我的，围巾是姐姐的，帽子是弟弟的。我们都找到了。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M16"><h3>Question 16 · Shopping before lunch</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m16.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">明天上午一起去买东西吧，十点见，好吗？</p><p class="cn">好，我八点吃早饭，十二点要回家。十点见正好。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M17"><h3>Question 17 · A time to call</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m17.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">今天下午什么时候能给你打电话？</p><p class="cn">三点我在上课，四点到家，五点出去。你四点打给我吧。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M18"><h3>Question 18 · Looking for shoes</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m18.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">我的白色运动鞋找不到了，你看见了吗？</p><p class="cn">门口有一双黑色的。</p><p class="cn">黑色的是爸爸的，我的白鞋在床下面。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M19"><h3>Question 19 · Two weekly outings</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m19.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">你这周有什么活动？</p><p class="cn">星期三下午去游泳，星期五下午去公园。我喜欢游泳，也喜欢和朋友在公园走走。</p></details></section><section class="box" id="C1B-M20"><h3>Question 20 · After finishing a drawing</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1b-m20.mp3"></audio><details><summary>Review transcript</summary><p class="cn">下午先去打球，好吗？</p><p class="cn">我想先把这张画画完，然后去打球。</p><p class="cn">好的，你画完以后叫我，我在家等你。</p></details></section></div><h2 class="sectiontitle">Speaking prompts · S1</h2><div class="audio-list"><section class="box"><h3>S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">你家有几个人？你和谁一起住？</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">周末你喜欢做什么？不喜欢做什么？</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">星期五你几点下课？下课后去哪儿？</p></details></section><section class="box"><h3>S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p>Two plays in this file; then allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to respond.</p><details><summary>Review prompt transcript</summary><p class="cn">星期天一起看电影，好吗？你上午还是下午有空？</p></details></section></div></main></body></html>